 enquiries form†apps.ncl.ac.uk .\nL379: \nL380: You can also call our switchboard on +44 (0) 191 208 6000.\nL381: \nL382: We don't have a University-wide email address but you can write to us. Our postal address is:\nL383: \nL384: Newcastle University\nL385: Newcastle upon Tyne\nL386: Tyne and Wear\nL387: NE1 7RU\nL388: United Kingdom\nL389: \nL390: cite337†Image†pxl-nclacuk.terminalfour.net L391: ## Specific enquiries\nL392: \nL393: You can also get in touch with individual teams for the following specific enquiries:\nL394: \nL395: Admissions enquiries\nL396: \nL397: If you’re a prospective student and want to find out about studying at Newcastle you can cite86†request a prospectus .\nL398: \nL399: If you have admissions questions fill in our cite336†enquiries form†apps.ncl.ac.uk and a member of the team will get back to you.\nL400: \nL401: Alumni enquiries\nL402: If you're a former student and want to find out about alumni events, volunteering or donating to the University contact the cite334†Newcastle University Advancement team .\nL403: \nL404: If you need to cite338†request a duplicate degree certificate or transcript visit our Student Progress website.\nL405: \nL406: Press and media\nL407: \nL408: Members of the press and media should contact our cite339†Press Office .\nL409: \nL410: Research and business consultancy\nL411: Businesses interested in recruiting students and graduates for work and placements can contact our cite340†Careers Service .\nL412: \nL413: To talk to us about cite262†research support , cite341†commercial services and consultancy contact our cite342†support teams .\nL414: \nL415: International relations\nL416: \nL417: If you're interested in finding out more about international relations at Newcastle University, you can contact us by email (internationalrelations@ncl.ac.uk).\nL418: \nL419: Student services enquiries\nL420: If you're a current student in need of support and guidance, please contact cite343†S